OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife body loses lynx High
OL,4,ACourt challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organisation trying to bring lynx
OL,7,Fback to northern England has lost a
OL,8,FHigh Court challenge.
OL,10,FLynx UK Trust applied for a three-year
OL,11,Ftrial in 2022 which could have seen
OL,12,Fthree of the animals from Sweden
OL,13,Freleased into Kielder Forest, but it
OL,14,Fwas refused by Natural England.
OL,16,FThe trust challenged the environmental
OL,17,Fbody over the refusal to proceed to a
OL,18,Ffull assessment but Ms Justice Obi
OL,19,Fdismissed the claim, saying: "On
OL,20,FNatural England's understanding of the
OL,21,Flaw, the proposed release could not
OL,22,Flawfully be implemented."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
