OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife body loses lynx High
OL,4,ACourt challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn July, Northumberland County Council
OL,7,Fbacked a motion stating it would not
OL,8,Fsupport any effort to release lynx into
OL,9,Fthe wild.
